  "selection": "Follow-up of the already selected four-award GAO family. Query the old VA MSPV URL in the Wayback CDX index for successful text/html captures in calendar 2024, without collapse or a result limit. Seven rows were returned. Review June 13, the first indexed capture after the May 31 original actions, and September 6, the latest indexed capture before the September 16 decision. An initial May 16 contextual fetch contains no table; it is not used to infer award absence. This is a purpose-selected source follow-up, not a protest or procurement sampling frame.",
  "scope": "Two archived versions of one agency page. Preserve every row of the June five-row award table and every entry of the September nineteen-area delivery-order list, with contact fields excluded. Snapshot, displayed update, original action, performance and protest dates are different observations. Capture-index completeness is limited to this URL, period and filters; it is not proof that all historical page versions exist.",
  "sourceAuthentication": "Read the acquired HTML and the ordinary browser replay. Cross-check all five June award rows and the full nineteen-entry September list plus its star note. The unchanged requested/resolved timestamp, Memento datetime and CDX SHA-1 agree with the acquired archived payload. September is gzip encoded: its compressed payload matches CDX, while the decoded HTML has a separate SHA-256. These checks tie bytes to the archive index; they do not independently verify VA's source assertions or manual interpretation. The public ledger excludes archived cookies and staff contacts.",
